<!doctype html>
<!-- Modified for the 2026 modernization; see NOTICE and CHANGELOG.md. -->
<html lang="en"><head>
<meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow, noarchive"><meta name="color-scheme" content="light dark"><meta name="referrer" content="no-referrer">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/app.css">
<title>Search your collection · Zero Trust Search</title>
<script src="/assets/search.js" defer></script>
</head><body><header class="site-header"><a class="brand" href="/"><span class="brand-mark" aria-hidden="true">ZT</span>Zero Trust Search</a><nav aria-label="Main navigation"><a href="/">Search</a><a href="/map">Spatial</a><a href="/faq">Guide</a></nav></header><main class="container"><section class="hero"><p class="eyebrow">RESTRICTED ANALYST WORKSPACE</p><h1>Investigate exposure.<br>Trace the evidence.</h1><p class="lead">Search approved breach datasets and review exposed identifiers with source context. For authorized cybersecurity and investigative work.</p></section>
<section class="panel" aria-labelledby="search-heading"><div class="section-heading"><div><h2 id="search-heading">Breach intelligence search</h2><p>Fill in at least one field. Different fields narrow the search together.</p></div><span class="badge">Up to {{maxResults}} results</span></div>
<form id="search-form" action="/records" method="get" autocomplete="off"><div class="form-grid"><label>Email<input name="emails" type="text" maxlength="256" placeholder="alex@example.invalid" autocomplete="off"></label>
<label>Domain<input name="domain" type="text" maxlength="256" placeholder="example.invalid" autocomplete="off"></label>
<label>Username<input name="usernames" type="text" maxlength="256" placeholder="demo-user" autocomplete="off"></label>
<label>Breach source<input name="source" type="text" maxlength="256" placeholder="synthetic-fixture" autocomplete="off"></label>
<label>First name<input name="firstName" type="text" maxlength="256" placeholder="Alex" autocomplete="off"></label>
<label>Last name<input name="lastName" type="text" maxlength="256" placeholder="Example" autocomplete="off"></label>
<label>City<input name="city" type="text" maxlength="256" placeholder="Example City" autocomplete="off"></label>
<label>Country<input name="country" type="text" maxlength="256" placeholder="US" autocomplete="off"></label></div><details class="advanced"><summary>Additional fields and exclusions</summary><div class="form-grid"><label>Address<input name="address" type="text" maxlength="256" autocomplete="off"></label>
<label>State or region<input name="state" type="text" maxlength="256" autocomplete="off"></label>
<label>Postal code<input name="zipCode" type="text" maxlength="256" autocomplete="off"></label>
<label>Birth year<input name="birthYear" type="text" maxlength="256" autocomplete="off"></label>
<label>IP address<input name="ips" type="text" maxlength="256" autocomplete="off"></label>
<label>ASN<input name="asn" type="text" maxlength="256" autocomplete="off"></label>
<label>Phone number<input name="phoneNumbers" type="text" maxlength="256" autocomplete="off"></label>
<label>Exclude source<input name="notsource" type="text" maxlength="256" autocomplete="off"></label></div></details><div class="form-actions"><button type="submit">Search records <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></button><button class="secondary" type="reset">Clear fields</button><p id="form-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p></div></form></section>
<div class="info-grid"><section><span class="step-label">01 / CHECK AN IDENTIFIER</span><h3>Search with purpose</h3><p>Start with an email, domain, or username within your authorized investigation. The included demo uses synthetic records only.</p></section><section><span class="step-label">02 / REVIEW THE SOURCE</span><h3>Keep the context</h3><p>Review the supplied breach date, data classes, and source reference. A dataset match is evidence to assess, not proof of a current compromise.</p></section><section><span class="step-label">03 / CONTROL ACCESS</span><h3>A private workspace</h3><p>This preview is for a trusted operator. Vetted organizational accounts, paid access, and evidence exports are part of the development roadmap.</p></section></div></main><footer class="site-footer"><span>Restricted analyst workspace</span><a href="/terms">Data handling</a></footer></body></html>
